Scope, and other people's work.

The licence above covers the Android application and launcher in this
repository only.

It does NOT cover the game. Skate 3 is not distributed here or in the APK;
players supply their own copy.

It does NOT cover the code this app is built on or ships alongside. The
published APK is a binary distribution that includes work by other authors
under their own licences:

  - darchap (BSD 3-Clause) - the foreground keep-alive service, and six
    settings that were his first: Vegetation, Pedestrians & Traffic, Movable
    Props, Hair Detail, Water Effects and the FPS Percentiles readout
  - Billy Laws (BSD 2-Clause) - libadrenotools and liblinkernsbypass
  - Alan Constantino - the GPU driver proxy, importer and selection UI
  - Mesa / Turnip, as published by MrPurple666 - the bundled driver
  - the upstream Skate 3 recompilation by Alex McHugh

Those notices are reproduced in THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md and, for the components
inside the APK, in app/src/main/assets/third-party/NOTICE.txt, which ships with
the application. Read them as part of this licence rather than beside it.
